pportunity for both end-users and investors seeking luxury living in the heart of JBR.<br> <br>Property Details<br><br>&nbsp1 Spacious Bedroom<br>&nbsp2 Modern Bathrooms<br>&nbsp856.27 Sq. Ft.<br>&nbspPrivate Balcony with Marina Views<br>&nbspFully Furnished<br>&nbspContemporary Open-Plan Kitchen with Built-in Appliances<br>&nbspCentral Air Conditioning<br>&nbsp1 Covered Parking Space<br><br><br>&nbsp Selling Price: AED 3,100,000<br><br>Building Features &amp; Amenities<br><br>&nbspResort-Style Swimming Pool<br>&nbspFully Equipped Fitness Centre<br>&nbspSauna &amp; Wellness Facilities<br>&nbspDirect Private Beach Access<br>&nbsp24/7 Security &amp; Concierge<br>&nbspSecure Gated Community<br>&nbspHigh-Speed Elevators<br>&nbspBasement Storage<br>&nbspPet-Friendly Environment<br><br>Prime Location<br><br>&nbsp Perfectly positioned within Jumeirah Beach Residence (JBR), residents enjoy direct access to the beach and are surrounded by world-class restaurants, luxury retail, entertainment venues, and lifestyle attractions, while remaining well connected to Dubai's key destinations.<br><br><br>&nbspBluewaters Island – 3 Minutes<br>&nbspDubai Marina – 5 Minutes<br>&nbspInternet City Metro Station – 7 Minutes<br>&nbspPalm Jumeirah – 10 Minutes<br>&nbspDubai Media City – 10 Minutes<br>&nbspDowntown Dubai – 20 Minutes<br><br><br>&nbsp Whether you're looking for a luxurious beachfront residence or a premium investment in one of Dubai's most desirable addresses, this apartment offers an exceptional blend of lifestyle, location, and long-term value.<br><br><br>&nbsp For more information or to arrange a private viewing, please contact:<br><br><br>&nbsp Sherif Matar<br>&nbsp Senior Property Consultant<br>&nbsp Provident Estate<br><br><br>&nbsp Provident Estate – Turning Real Estate Opportunities into Lasting Investments.<br><br> <br> <br> <br> <br> <br> <br> <br> ","longitude":55.1351809,"negotiator_id":"7968","negotiator_mapping":"sherif@providentestate.com","parking":["1"],"price